<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10207" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">con-frĭco</span></b> , āvi,
			ātum, 1, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>v. a., to rub vigorously, to rub in</i> (belonging
			to econom. and medic. lang.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> Prop.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">caput atque os suum unguento,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Verr. 2, 3, 25, § 62</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">os sale trito,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					7, 10, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">boves,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 2,
					3, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">confricatis dentibus atque gingivis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					29, 2, 9, § 31</span></i>
			: faciem sibi, * <i><span class="en">Suet.
				Claud. 8 <i>fin.</i></span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">oculum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Veg. Art. Vet. 3, 20, 1</span></i>
			.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Meton.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">genua,</span>”
				i. e. <i>to touch the knees in earnest entreaty</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. As. 3, 3, 80</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
